The http-client import is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read@0.1.0`, and the linker refuses anything outside that grant. The platform team's approval doesn't change this: it has to be made by adding `HTTPClient<[metadata.internal.example]>` to the node's `with` clause in the graph. Once that is done, the enrichment fetch can come back. Its result was discarded and the output was unchanged, so leaving it out changes nothing the node produces. Note that `run-info` has no text field; my earlier attempt used `date` as the `q` value, and that choice needs confirming.

